        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "129. An employee who is permanently transferred to a position in a lower grade shall receive the step rate which is equal to or next below his/her former rate. In addition, the employee shall receive credit for time spent in the assigned step rate of his/her former classification in determining his/her eligible date for future step rate increases in his/her new classification unless he/she is receiving the maximum step rate of his/her classification at the time of transfer to the lower grade. (For transfers between geographical areas, see Appendix A, Sections 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5).",
