        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "131. Using the “Kaiser Foundation Hospitals Manual for the Evaluation of Clerical Positions,” the Employer and the Union have jointly classified each existing position into one of the scheduled grades on the basis of the duties and responsibilities of the position.",
