        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "132. An employee who is permanently promoted to a position in a higher grade or classification (a higher starting rate of pay) shall be paid the first step of the new position grade or classification which is next above his/her former rate and which will provide an increase of at least $0.15 per hour.",
            "block_bbox": [
