            "block_content": "134. An employee who is transferred to another position in the same grade: 1) shall receive not less than his/her former rate (Structure A employees only); and 2) shall receive credit for time spent at his/her assigned step rate in his/her former position for the purpose of determining the date of his/her step rate",
